      "content": "escalation is just more of the same. it’s just another layer of the same wall. i look at the pile of letters and the voicemails and i just feel... nothing. like there’s no point in even being here to deal with it. why keep being a person if the world is just gonna pretend you aren't there? it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just let go.",
